<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK VUB 96 GROSS PROFIT SKK 79.6 MLN - IAS.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK VUB 96 GROSS PROFIT SKK 79.6 MLN - IAS.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>VUB a.s., Slovakia's largest commercial bank, said on Friday its 1996 pre-tax 1996 gross profit, calculated according to international accounting standards (IAS), was 79.6 million crowns compared to 2.91 billion crowns in 1995.</p>
<p>VUB Vice-president Dusan Paulik said the bank was satisfied with this result as it also created reserves totalling 1.5 billion crowns for classified loans.</p>
</text>
